      "System.Description": "<p>As the platform team, we need checkout to support additional markets, languages, and currencies, so that international expansion is not blocked by checkout. </p><p>Checkout is English-only, EUR-only, and offers cards and PayPal only. The shop already ships to several EU markets; checkout has not followed the international expansion. Sales wants five additional markets live this year. Support reports non-English tickets already take days to resolve. Finance has no position on display currencies and FX pricing. There is no single owner for international checkout. </p><p>Scope is not defined: markets, languages, currencies, and local payment methods are all open. </p>",
